---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /faq.html
title: FAQ
metaTitle: "RCPD FAQ — What It Is, Symptoms, Causes & Botox Treatment"
description: "Straight answers about RCPD (no-burp syndrome): what causes it, how it's diagnosed, whether Botox works, how long it lasts, and what to do next."
---

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "@id": "{{ site.url }}/faq.html#faq",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for item in faqs %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ item.q | dump | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": {{ item.schemaText | dump | safe }}
      }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<section class="page-head section section--tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
    <h1>Questions &amp; answers</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The basics of RCPD &mdash; what it is, what it feels like, and how it's treated.
      Still unsure? The <a href="{{ site.reddit }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">r/noburp</a>
      community is a good place to ask.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="faq">
      {%- for item in faqs %}
      <details class="faq__item"{% if item.open %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
        <div class="faq__body">
          {%- for block in item.a %}
          {%- if block.list %}
          <ul class="stack">
            {%- for li in block.list %}
            <li>{{ li | safe }}</li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
          {%- else %}
          <p>{{ block | safe }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- endfor %}
          {%- if item.extra %}
          {{ item.extra | safe }}
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
